            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>截至台北時間19日01:12，集中市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>下跌1697.49點（或4.22%），暫報38497.42點。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li>近 1 週：-9.18%</li><li>近 1 月：-14.68%</li><li>近 3 月：-11.29%</li><li>近 6 月：-1.7%</li><li>今年以來：+38.78%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>焦點個股</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>測試介面概念領跌-9.86%。其中    中探針(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6217:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6217\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6217-TW</a>)            下跌        10%            ;        穎崴(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6515:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6515\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6515-TW</a>)            下跌        9.97%            ;        健策(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3653:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3653\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3653-TW</a>)            下跌        9.96%    。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>光學鏡頭概念領跌-9.59%。其中    玉晶光(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3406:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3406\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3406-TW</a>)            下跌        10%            ;        中揚光(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6668:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6668\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6668-TW</a>)            下跌        9.98%            ;        今國光(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6209:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6209\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6209-TW</a>)            下跌        9.96%    。</p></section></main>",
